  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: TLS certificates issued by compromised eMudhra\n     intermediate CAs are accepted (CVE-2026-115557)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115557.patch: add a denylist of the SHA-256\n       digests of the compromised intermediates' public keys\n       (Modules/_ssl/distrusted_spki.h) and install a verify callback at both\n       SSL_CTX_set_verify() sites in Modules/_ssl.c, so a chain containing\n       one of those keys fails verification with X509_V_ERR_CERT_REJECTED;\n       add a regression test to Lib/test/test_ssl.py with its certificates\n       in Lib/test/distrusted.zip.b64, and a Misc/NEWS.d entry\n     - CVE-2026-115557",
